{"id":"34d8f1fe14ad686e59b567fe2593cd797f775298","axis":"silent","repo":"pnpm/pnpm","sha":"34d8f1fe14ad686e59b567fe2593cd797f775298","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".changeset/standalone-projects-outside-the-workspace.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@","+---","+\"@pnpm/workspace.package-patterns\": patch","+\"@pnpm/workspace.projects-reader\": patch","+\"@pnpm/workspace.root-finder\": patch","+\"pacquet\": patch","+\"pnpm\": patch","+---","+","+A command run in a project that the workspace does not include now acts on that project alone. A project is outside the workspace when it has a manifest of its own and no pattern in the `packages` setting selects it, or when a `!` pattern excludes it. A directory with no manifest of its own, such as a package's source directory, still belongs to the workspace. `pnpm install` in an excluded project used to install every project in the workspace [#3561](https://github.com/pnpm/pnpm/issues/3561)."],"additions":9,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"Cargo.lock","lines":["@@ -4782,6 +4782,7 @@ dependencies = [","  \"pnpm-store-dir\",","  \"pnpm-testing-utils\",","  \"pnpm-versioning\",","+ \"pnpm-workspace\",","  \"pnpm-workspace-state\",","  \"pnpr-registry\",","  \"pretty_assertions\","],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm-lock.yaml","lines":["@@ -10088,6 +10088,22 @@ importers:","         specifier: 'catalog:'","         version: 1.0.2"," ","+  pnpm11/workspace/package-patterns:","+    dependencies:","+      micromatch:","+        specifier: 'catalog:'","+        version: 4.0.8","+    devDependencies:","+      '@jest/globals':","+        specifier: 'catalog:'","+        version: 30.4.1(supports-color@10.2.2)","+      '@pnpm/workspace.package-patterns':","+        specifier: workspace:*","+        version: 'link:'","+      '@types/micromatch':","+        specifier: 'catalog:'","+        version: 4.0.10","+","   pnpm11/workspace/project-manifest-reader:","     dependencies:","       '@pnpm/error':","@@ -1029